tyle=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">独自出行、预算有限</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">赶时间、行李轻便的人</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">中途要下车的人，例如去Putrajaya</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">家庭、团体、行李多、深夜抵达</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
